{"id":"97a98663b21af886","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-system-t-normal-form.md","title":"System T的正规形图","display":"df-system-t-normal-form — System T的正规形图","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-system-t-normal-form","aliases":["72-df-system-t-normal-form"],"display":"df-system-t-normal-form — System T的正规形图","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-normalization-proof]]"],"chapter":"V","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V Definition4.2.1, print358/PDF370","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-system-t-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-system-t-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-system-t-normal-form — System T的正规形图"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db757aa1a8cf57f3\" href=\"?note=db757aa1a8cf57f3\" title=\"72-df-normalization-proof\">72-df-normalization-proof</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"V"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V Definition4.2.1, print358/PDF370"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_T\">\\(\\rho_T\\)</span> 为本册带类型 β/recursor 的兼容归约；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathcal T_\\sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c\">\\(\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c\\)</span> 为适型项与封闭适型项，均按 α 类读取。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TNF}_\\sigma(s,t):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\rho_T^*\\land\\neg\\exists u\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma\\ (\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in\\rho_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TNF}_\\sigma(s,t):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\rho_T^*\\land\\neg\\exists u\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma\\ (\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in\\rho_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正规形关系同时要求可达和不可继续归约，不以“与某个数值指称相同”替代句法计算。闭包的恒等关系在同一适型项载体上解释；所有根部与上下文归约均采用已有 ρT。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-normalization-proof","status":"resolved","id":"db757aa1a8cf57f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-normalization-proof]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\rho_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TNF}_\\sigma(s,t):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\rho_T^*\\land\\neg\\exists u\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma\\ (\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in\\rho_T).","display":true}],"bytes":1345,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增8项：[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]] · [[72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer]] · [[72-df-system-t-typing-judgment]] · [[72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution]] · [[72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity]] · [[72-thm-system-t-normalization]] · [[72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy]] · [[72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增8项：[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]] · [[72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer]] · [[72-df-system-t-typing-judgment]] · [[72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution]] · [[72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity]] · [[72-thm-system-t-normalization]] · [[72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy]] · [[72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增8项：[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]] · [[72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer]] · [[72-df-system-t-typing-judgment]] · [[72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution]] · [[72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity]] · [[72-thm-system-t-normalization]] · [[72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy]] · [[72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction]]"},{"id":"852e36a39d13964a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"项、类型及 $\\rho_T$ 取 [[72-df-system-t-normal-form]] 的System T接口；$\\overline0:=\\mathbf0$，$\\overline{n+1}:=\\mathsf S\\overline n$；$t\\in\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0}^c$。正常项在所有子项处均无 β 或 recursor redex。"},{"id":"d1bdc5d626d71488","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"类型、适型项、归约及正规形关系取 [[72-df-system-t-normal-form]]，类型保持见 [[72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction]]，合流性谓词见 [[72-df-confluence]]；$\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{Ty}$；$R_\\sigma:=\\rho_T\\cap\\mathcal T_\\sigma^2$。$\\operatorname{Conf}$、$\\operatorname{TNF}$ 取相同关系载体与 α 商。"}],"outgoing":["b4e2c27ac178897e","db757aa1a8cf57f3"]}